{\rtf1\ansi\deff0 {\fonttbl {\f0 Segoe UI;}}\f0\fs20 Fellowship\par\par
Windows LAN companion for BFME2 1.00 over Radmin VPN.\par
Fellowship installs for your Windows account and starts in the system tray when you sign in. You can turn this off in Settings.\par\par
Your preferences are stored separately in your local application data and are preserved during upgrades and uninstall.\par\par
BFME2 and Radmin VPN are separate products and must already be installed. Fellowship does not include game files.}
